 * Is the certificate on the wire plausibly from the issuer we use for this row?
 *
 * Returns true when we cannot tell. A false mismatch is as misleading as a
 * missed one (the same reasoning as `majorVersion` in worker/migrate-real.ts):
 * refusing to adopt an expiry we have no grounds to doubt would strand rows on
 * stale dates, which is the very failure this is meant to prevent.
