// Proving the credential works
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// M7 #8: success here used to be "the CREATE statement exited 0 as root", and
// `passwordEnc` is nulled in the very same update that writes ACTIVE — so if the
// generated credential did not actually work, nobody could re-derive it, and the
